{% comment %}
  Saitriq Wishlist — App Embed block
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  This is the MASTER ON/OFF switch for the entire wishlist app.

  Merchants enable/disable it from:
    Online Store → Themes → Customize → App embeds → Saitriq Wishlist

  When ENABLED:
    - Loads wishlist.css globally (once, for the whole page)
    - Sets window.saitriqEmbedEnabled = true
    - All wishlist blocks (product button, collection icons, wishlist page)
      check this flag before activating. If it's not set they render nothing.

  When DISABLED:
    - This block is not rendered at all by Shopify
    - window.saitriqEmbedEnabled is never set
    - All wishlist blocks silently output nothing
    - No JS runs, no CSS loads, no proxy calls are made
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'wishlist.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<script>
  // Set the global flag — all wishlist blocks wait for this before activating
  window.saitriqEmbedEnabled = true;
  // Dispatch event for any blocks that loaded before this embed script ran
  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('saitriq:embed-ready'));
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Saitriq Wishlist",
  "target": "body",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
